
# Library Management System

## Project Overview
This project is a Python-based Library Management System using Object-Oriented Programming (OOP).

## Features
- Add and display books
- Register and display members
- Borrow and return books
- Track book due dates
- Check overdue books
- Save and load data using JSON
- Menu-driven interface

## Technologies Used
- Python 3
- Object-Oriented Programming
- Classes and Objects
- JSON
- Date and Time module

## Project Structure
- library_system/book.py
- library_system/member.py
- library_system/library.py
- library_system/main.py
- library_system/library_data.json

## How to Run
Open a terminal inside the library_system folder and run:

python main.py

